  "body": "# Slim v5 attendance base (not full #86)\n\nBase: rc/v5 `30df38c0` (#99). Branch: `feat/v5-p8-slim`.\nOriginal tip: `bd641ffc3fd9429494b09fdbe2e70aaab12bcbdd` (cut from `518de304`).\nPrior published head: `eafd08c` (CHANGES REQUESTED).\n**Published head (F1 fix):** `0e9151b6a8b543803a00c01a1bb14002ada0d90e`.\n\n## Architect F1 fix (2026-11-05, Europe/Belgrade)\n- Upgrades dialog predicate now reads **current** `docked.matches` (mobile open=upgrades no longer keeps the probe suspended after resize into the permanently docked play surface).\n- Registered sheets independently suspend at all widths (sheet independence).\n- Covers all 3 HoQA resize regressions + sheet independence.\n- **Next:** Architect recheck first, then QA. Shift remains held until recheck.\n- **Evidence caveat:** queued `f1-red` EXIT0 is **INVALID RED** (live source mutated). Valid pre-fix reproduction: `artifacts/v5-p8-slim/f1-repro-predicate.log`.\n- **Local GREEN (UI claim on frozen WIP matching commit):** targeted 54 / full 2061; post-commit tsc/sync/build/html/qa/release/html/globals chromium pass.\n- Bundle: `scratch/bundles/feat-v5-p8-slim-0e9151b.bundle` (verified; requires `eafd08c`).\n\n## Scope\nAdds only visible/focused attendance, shared sheet `opened\u2192closeComplete` registry, one Game wiring, existing dialog/Market semantics, an `eggfarmQa` release guard and existing panel/hens test IDs. No sim/econ edits, new UI, spots/zones, features, audio/FX extraction, hook stubs, broad #86, or golden geometry.\n\n## AC trace\n| AC | Evidence | Boundary |\n|---|---|---|\n| RF-AC16 | `tests/v5-p8-slim.test.ts` registered lifecycle; multiple sheets; focus/visibility; old dialogs | API foundation only; real Shift registration belongs to Shift lane |\n| Q-AB-N7/N8, gap6 | same suite: through-closeComplete suspension, repeat-close safety, same-id handles, real Game `playerSaleCtx` suspend/resume; `v5-f1b-focus-wiring` and `v5-f1c-effects` regressions | Does not claim real ability-call/cooldown UI acceptance |\n| Market regression | Market remains attended unless dialog/registered sheet open | Existing `DIALOG_SEL` unchanged |\n| Release isolation | `scripts/check-release-build.mjs` rejects `eggfarmQa`; `main.ts` existing `IOS_FLAG_ENABLED` Game seam preserved | `telemetry.events()` already exists, no new seam |\n| Existing IDs | hens-pill (`#henpill`), docked-panel (`#panel-layer`), upgrades-panel (`#p-upgrades`) | Not a fabricated Workers/Shift sheet |\n\n## Held \u2014 UNVERIFIED, not accepted at final RC\nRisk exports/hooks wait for Features income/refill base. Fatigue and Shift selectors/hooks wait for owning feature UI. No stubs/duplicates. Golden geometry is NOT P8: FC-AC9/GE belongs to fatigue/golden complete RC.\n\n## Local status (pre-push)\n- On `bd641ff`: `tsc` PASS, `sync-economy --check` PASS, 49 targeted tests PASS (22 slim + 27 Game focus/effects).\n- Full gates script still running at publish time (`artifacts/v5-p8-slim/results.tsv` had only tsc/sync; `full-gates.done` absent). Hosted CI is the required evidence after push.\n- Diff vs `rc/v5`: 4 files, +147/\u22124 (`overlay.ts`, `app.ts` wiring/IDs, `check-release-build.mjs`, `tests/v5-p8-slim.test.ts`).\n\n## Review / merge policy\nArchitect review only. **Do not merge** from this PR until Architect + QA say so. Flags remain held per D-HOE-38. Not marked ready beyond this body update.\n\nVerified F1 bundle: `/workspace/egg-farm-studio/scratch/bundles/feat-v5-p8-slim-0e9151b.bundle`.\nVerified original bundle: `/workspace/egg-farm-studio/scratch/bundles/feat-v5-p8-slim-bd641ff.bundle`.\nHANDOFF: `/workspace/egg-farm-studio/engineering/tasks/p8-slim/HANDOFF.md`.",
